The Iowa Alcoholic Beverages Division  and I are examining the Brandy category across seven
subcategories (American Grape, Imported Grape, Miscellaneous, Apricot, Blackberry, Cherry, and
Peach Brandies) to find market strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats. 

